package store

// SearchAccelerated reports whether this build links an accelerated
// full-text index for Search to consult on a large store. The
// tree-sitter extractor already links CGO into this same binary for
// general-language parsing, so a CGO-backed accelerator here would ride
// on a dependency the release already pays for rather than add a new one.
//
// The current build always returns false: no accelerator is linked yet,
// so Search always takes its pure-Go scan.
func SearchAccelerated() bool {
	return false
}

